<meta name='title' content="6NZL zinc site: POS-1 tandem fingers (worm), no RNA"/>
<meta name='description' content="NMR, 20 models. Model 1 as deposited. One unit is one angstrom. A bond to zinc glows only while it measures under 2.5 angstrom. Materials, lights, radii and the cage faces are look, not data."/>
